										"Text":
										{
											"$text": "Document Title: \"Target Assessment Brief – Quarry Sector UICS Installations\"  \r\nDate: 2024-11-04  \r\nClassification: Top Secret – Direct Action Recommended\r\n\r\nOverview:  \r\nSurveillance teams have identified multiple UICS-controlled structures in and around the quarry region. These locations support production, logistics, and command functions tied to operations in the central corridor. The following sites are marked for sabotage, infiltration, or strategic surveillance.\r\n\r\n-----------------------------------------------------\r\nTier 1 – Priority Targets\r\n\r\n• SITE DESIGNATION: BLOCK-7  \r\n  Type: UICS Quarry Block Factory  \r\n  Location: Northern edge of quarry basin  \r\n  Notes: Actively producing reinforced modular blocks used in subterranean structure reinforcement. Limited external defense, heavy material flow suggests priority status. Recommended: nighttime approach + remote detonation.\r\n\r\n• SITE DESIGNATION: BASE-QUARRY  \r\n  Type: UICS Military Outpost  \r\n  Location: Western high-ground ridge overlooking the quarry  \r\n  Notes: Well-defended. High patrol frequency. Believed to house intel terminals and encrypted uplink systems. Risk of reinforcement high. Potential intel jackpot. Recommended: stealth recon only until path is confirmed.\r\n\r\n-----------------------------------------------------\r\nTier 2 – Secondary Observation\r\n\r\n• SITE DESIGNATION: CORE-PIT  \r\n  Type: Primary Quarry Extraction Zone  \r\n  Location: Central pit, open terrain  \r\n  Notes: Constant UICS drone traffic observed. Raw resource extraction underway. Possibly tied to BLOCK-7 logistics. Patrols light, but sightlines wide. Risk of exposure high.\r\n\r\n• SITE DESIGNATION: CAVE-DELTA  \r\n  Type: Natural Cave System (suspected forward node)  \r\n  Location: Southeast rim of quarry perimeter  \r\n  Notes: Limited visual contact. Thermal returns suggest low-volume movement and occasional shortwave bursts. Possibly used for temporary staging or covert relay.\r\n\r\n-----------------------------------------------------\r\nAction Items:\r\n- Prioritize BLOCK-7 for disruption operation; coordinate with Demo Team Echo.\r\n- Conduct passive relay sweep near CAVE-DELTA to confirm or deny node usage.\r\n- Maintain watch on BASE-QUARRY; extraction team needed before further action.\r\n\r\nCompiled by:  \r\nIntel Section 4D – Vanguard Recon  \r\nAuth. Code: RX-VLF-9342Z  \r\nStatus: Cleared for tactical distribution",
											"$ns": "[680EB13DB6AABA9D965D692ABD17282F]",
											"$key": "C633466E44F19F9D520CD586F9580D98"
										}
